{"server":"kr","storyId":"main_2_level_main_02-07_end","groupId":"main_2","stageId":"main_02-07","title":"위생관리","storyCode":"2-7","avgTag":"작전 후","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/kr/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_02-07_end.txt","sourceHash":"e0b55e1adeef0bbadf48800f5a7dacf835a66b1a037de25b2b798dc765899d9e","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第十九关（后）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lungmen_b"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"감염자","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"고맙다… 정말 고마워…"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"아미야","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"여기는 아직 위험해요. 빨리 벗어나세요."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"감염자","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"여길 벗어나서…"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"감염자","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"벗어나서… 어디로 가라는 거야?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"감염자","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"여기가 우리 집인데… 전부, 망가져 버렸지만…"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"아미야","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"…죄송해요."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"감염자","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"아냐… 너희 잘못이 아닌걸."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"감염자","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"너희 잘못이… 아니야……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"엑시아","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"감염자 구제 조직을 자칭하는 리유니온이 감염자를 공격하다니."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"엑시아","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"이제 이미지고 뭐고 상관없다 이건가."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"텍사스","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"리유니온이 용문에 침투해 있다는 건… 절대 자발적인 게 아니야."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"텍사스","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"원래 용문에 살던 감염자들이 리유니온에 가담하게 된 거지."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"엑시아","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"흐음, 리유니온은 믿지만, 로도스 아일랜드는 믿을 수 없다는 거구나…"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"프란카","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"그래도 로도스 아일랜드는 처음부터 안 되는 걸 된다고 하지는 않아."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"프란카","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"그에 반해, 리유니온은 감염자에게 거짓된 환상을 심어주지."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"프란카","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"지금이야 대부분 그 환상을 품는 법마저 잊어버린 것 같지만…"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"프란카","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"대부분의 감염자는 이게 환상인지 아닌지 신경 쓰지 않아. 물에 빠진 채 지푸라기라도 잡는 심정이었겠지."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"프란카","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"그런 환상에 빠진 감염자가, 거짓말도 못 하고 비위도 맞춰줄 줄 모르는 정직한 토끼 아가씨 말을 믿겠어?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"아미야","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"미샤","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"…나는 믿어."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"아미야","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"…미샤 씨…?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"미샤","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"으윽…"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"아미야","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"조심하세요! 아직 움직이시면 안 돼요!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"미샤","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"머리가 조금 어지러운 것뿐이야… 괜찮아."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"미샤","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"리유니온이… 아직도 쫓아오고 있지?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"미샤","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"그들의 목적은 잘 모르겠지만…"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"미샤","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"단지…"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"미샤","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"아니다… 일어나볼까…"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"미샤","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"아미야."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"아미야","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"아미야","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"알았어요."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"아미야","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"그럼 바로 움직이죠."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"아미야","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"조금 있으면 슬럼가 구역을 벗어나, 근위국과 합류하기로 한 곳에 도착할 거예요."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"아미야","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"고마워요. 미샤 씨."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"미샤","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"아니야…"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"미샤","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"내가… 감사해야지."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["아미야"]},{"speakerId":"char_012_misa","aliases":["미샤"]},{"speakerId":"char_102_texas","aliases":["텍사스"]},{"speakerId":"char_103_angel","aliases":["엑시아"]},{"speakerId":"char_106_franka","aliases":["프란카"]}]}
